<title>FRANCE: U.S. main destination for Jan-April Paris exports.</title>
<headline>U.S. main destination for Jan-April Paris exports.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States was the largest market for export traffic from the Paris airports in Jan-Apr 1997, Paris airport authority figures show.</p>
<p>The 20 top destinations by country for ADP exports in Jan-Apr 1997, with percentage change on Jan-Apr 1996 were:</p>
<p>	REGION	     TONNAGE     PCT CHANGE</p>
<p>  1. United States     40,684	up     7.3</p>
<p>  2. Japan		 10,176	down  12.1</p>
<p>  3.  Germany	     7,888	up    27.1</p>
<p>  4.  Hong Kong	   7,471	up     6.5</p>
<p>  5.  Canada		6,530	down   8.5</p>
<p>  6.  UK		    6,289	up    28.7</p>
<p>  7.  Brazil		5,260	up    16.2</p>
<p>  8.  U.A.E.		5,184	up    15.1</p>
<p>  9. Mexico		 4,334	up    18.1</p>
<p> 10.  India		 4,190	down  11.8</p>
<p> 11. Fr.W Indies	  3,874	down   5.8</p>
<p> 12. Singapore	    3,645	up    45.2</p>
<p> 13. Saudi Arabia	 3,290	down  17.3</p>
<p> 14. Reunion		3,222	up     0.5</p>
<p> 15. Thailand	     2,733	up    13.7</p>
<p> 16. Egypt		  2,731	down   5.7</p>
<p> 17. Italy		  2,572	down  17.8</p>
<p> 18. Lebanon		2,505	up     7.7</p>
<p> 19. Korea		  2,369	down   7.1</p>
<p> 20. China		  2,029	down  19.3</p>
<p>    TOTAL		 186,532	up     1.5</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
